|
|               (1) C6748 ZCE contains dual rail I/O buffers that 
|                   are capable of running are two different core 
|                   voltages depedent on the schematic hookup
|                       (a) 1.8V 
|                       (b) 3.3V
|               (2) Specific Model Sections/Name Decoders are determined
|                   based upon the value that is supplied to the 
|                   particular I/O buffer as well as any pull up/down 
|                   resistors that are selected. Refer to the Model Selecter 
|                   Definitions for details regarding model selection at 
|                   1.8V rail or the 3.3V rail.
